async function loadMediaCleanup(force=false){if(mediaCleanupReport&&!force)return renderMediaCleanup();const notice=$('#mediaCleanupNotice'),list=$('#mediaCleanupList');if(notice)notice.textContent='Scanning known references…';if(list)list.innerHTML='<p class="notice">Checking media usage, duplicates and local file health…</p>';try{mediaCleanupReport=await api('/admin/operations/media/maintenance');const liveIds=new Set((mediaCleanupReport.media||[]).map(x=>x.id));mediaCleanupSelected=new Set([...mediaCleanupSelected].filter(id=>liveIds.has(id)));renderMediaCleanup()}catch(e){if(notice)notice.textContent='Cleanup scan failed.';if(list)list.innerHTML=`<p class="error">${esc(e.message)}</p>`}}
function mediaCleanupCandidates(){const all=(mediaCleanupReport?.media||[]).filter(x=>x.unused||x.broken||x.duplicate);if(mediaCleanupFilter==='unused')return all.filter(x=>x.unused);if(mediaCleanupFilter==='broken')return all.filter(x=>x.broken);if(mediaCleanupFilter==='duplicate')return all.filter(x=>x.duplicate);return all}
function isRecentMedia(item){const created=new Date(item.createdAt).getTime();return Number.isFinite(created)&&Date.now()-created<14*86400000}
function renderMediaCleanup(){const panel=$('#mediaCleanupPanel'),summary=$('#mediaCleanupSummary'),notice=$('#mediaCleanupNotice'),list=$('#mediaCleanupList');if(!panel||!mediaCleanupReport||!summary||!notice||!list)return;const report=mediaCleanupReport.media||[],s=mediaCleanupReport.summary||{},candidates=mediaCleanupCandidates(),selectedItems=report.filter(x=>mediaCleanupSelected.has(x.id)),selectedBytes=selectedItems.reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x.size||0),0),duplicates=report.filter(x=>x.duplicate).length;summary.innerHTML=`<div><strong>${Number(s.total||report.length)}</strong><span>SCANNED</span></div><div><strong>${Number(s.unused||0)}</strong><span>UNUSED</span></div><div><strong>${Number(s.broken||0)}</strong><span>BROKEN</span></div><div><strong>${formatBytes(s.estimatedReclaimBytes||0)}</strong><span>POTENTIAL RECLAIM</span></div>`;panel.querySelectorAll('[data-cleanup-filter]').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('active',x.dataset.cleanupFilter===mediaCleanupFilter));const trash=$('#mediaCleanupTrash');if(trash){trash.disabled=!mediaCleanupSelected.size;trash.textContent=mediaCleanupSelected.size?`MOVE ${mediaCleanupSelected.size} TO TRASH · ${formatBytes(selectedBytes)}`:'MOVE TO TRASH'}notice.innerHTML=`<strong>${candidates.length}</strong> candidate${candidates.length===1?'':'s'} shown · <strong>${mediaCleanupSelected.size}</strong> selected · <strong>${duplicates}</strong> duplicate flag${duplicates===1?'':'s'}. “Safe select” excludes protected and uploads newer than 14 days. Remote assets still require manual review.`;list.innerHTML=candidates.map(item=>{const recent=isRecentMedia(item),selectable=Boolean(item.unused&&!item.keep),tags=[item.unused?'UNUSED':'',item.broken?'BROKEN':'',item.duplicate?'DUPLICATE':'',recent?'RECENT':'',item.keep?'KEEP':''].filter(Boolean);return `<article class="media-cleanup-item ${mediaCleanupSelected.has(item.id)?'selected':''}"><label class="media-cleanup-check"><input type="checkbox" data-cleanup-select="${esc(item.id)}" ${mediaCleanupSelected.has(item.id)?'checked':''} ${selectable?'':'disabled'}><span class="sr-only">Select ${esc(item.filename)}</span></label><div class="media-cleanup-thumb">${String(item.mimeType||'').startsWith('image/')?`<img src="${esc(item.url)}" alt="" loading="lazy">`:'<span>FILE</span>'}</div><div class="media-cleanup-info"><strong>${esc(item.originalName||item.filename)}</strong><small>${formatBytes(item.size)} · ${item.createdAt?new Date(item.createdAt).toLocaleDateString():'DATE UNKNOWN'} · ${Number(item.usageCount||0)} KNOWN REFERENCES</small><div class="media-cleanup-badges">${tags.map(tag=>`<span class="${tag.toLowerCase()}">${tag}</span>`).join('')}</div>${item.brokenReason?`<p>${esc(item.brokenReason)}</p>`:''}</div><div class="media-cleanup-row-actions">${item.broken&&String(item.mimeType||'').startsWith('image/')?`<button type="button" class="admin-btn primary" data-cleanup-replace="${esc(item.id)}">REPLACE IMAGE</button>`:'' }<a class="admin-btn" href="${esc(item.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">VIEW FILE</a>${item.unused&&!item.keep?`<button type="button" class="admin-btn" data-cleanup-keep="${esc(item.id)}">KEEP</button>`:''}</div></article>`}).join('')||'<p class="success">No candidates match this filter.</p>';observeMediaImages(list)}
function selectSafeUnusedMedia(){if(!mediaCleanupReport)return;mediaCleanupSelected=new Set((mediaCleanupReport.media||[]).filter(x=>x.unused&&!x.keep&&!isRecentMedia(x)).map(x=>x.id));renderMediaCleanup()}
async function keepCleanupAsset(id){if(!id)return;try{await api('/admin/media/'+encodeURIComponent(id),{method:'PATCH',body:JSON.stringify({keep:true})});mediaCleanupSelected.delete(id);showToast('Asset marked KEEP. Future cleanup scans will exclude it.');await loadMediaCleanup(true);await loadMedia()}catch(e){showToast(e.message,false)}}
async function moveCleanupSelectionToTrash(){const ids=[...mediaCleanupSelected];if(!ids.length)return;const rows=(mediaCleanupReport?.media||[]).filter(x=>ids.includes(x.id)),bytes=rows.reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x.size||0),0);if(!confirm(`Move ${ids.length} reviewed unused asset(s) (${formatBytes(bytes)}) to Trash? Known references will be checked again. Nothing is permanently deleted.`))return;let deleted=0,blocked=[];try{setLoading(true,'MOVING UNUSED MEDIA TO TRASH…');for(let i=0;i<ids.length;i+=100){const result=await api('/admin/media/bulk-delete',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({ids:ids.slice(i,i+100)})});deleted+=Number(result.deleted||0);blocked.push(...(result.blocked||[]))}mediaCleanupSelected.clear();showToast(blocked.length?`${deleted} moved to Trash; ${blocked.length} protected by current references.`:`${deleted} asset(s) moved safely to Trash.`,!blocked.length);await Promise.all([loadMedia(),loadMediaCleanup(true)])}catch(e){showToast(e.message,false);await loadMediaCleanup(true)}finally{setLoading(false)}}
function openMediaDetail(id){const m=mediaItems.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!m)return;const detail=$('#mediaDetail');detail.innerHTML=`<div class="media-detail-preview"><img src="${esc(m.url)}" alt="${esc(m.alt||m.originalName)}"></div><div class="panel-heading-row"><div><span class="kicker">MEDIA DETAILS</span><h2>${esc(m.originalName)}</h2><p class="notice">${esc(m.mimeType)} · ${formatBytes(m.size)}${m.width&&m.height?' · '+m.width+'×'+m.height:''}</p></div></div><form id="mediaEditForm" class="form"><label>ALT TEXT<input id="mediaAlt" value="${esc(m.alt||'')}"></label><label>TITLE<input id="mediaTitle" value="${esc(m.title||'')}"></label><label>DESCRIPTION<textarea id="mediaDescription">${esc(m.description||'')}</textarea></label><label>PUBLIC CAPTION<textarea id="mediaCaption">${esc(m.caption||'')}</textarea></label><label>CREATOR<input id="mediaCreator" value="${esc(m.creator||'')}"></label><label>CREDIT<input id="mediaCredit" value="${esc(m.credit||'')}"></label><label><input id="mediaDecorative" type="checkbox" ${m.decorative?'checked':''}> DECORATIVE IMAGE (EMPTY ALT IS INTENTIONAL)</label><label>TAGS<input id="mediaTags" value="${esc((m.tags||[]).join(', '))}" placeholder="amazon, a+, product"></label><div class="admin-actions"><button class="admin-btn primary">SAVE CHANGES</button><button type="button" class="admin-btn" id="mediaDownloadOne">DOWNLOAD</button><button type="button" class="admin-btn" id="mediaOptimizeOne">OPTIMIZE COPY</button><button type="button" class="admin-btn danger" id="mediaDeleteOne">DELETE FILE</button></div></form><div class="media-usage"><span class="kicker">USED IN</span>${m.usage?.length?m.usage.map(u=>`<div class="media-usage-row"><strong>${esc(u.kind)}</strong><small>${esc(u.label)}</small></div>`).join(''):'<p class="notice">Unused media — safe candidate for cleanup.</p>'}</div>`;$('#mediaEditForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();try{await api('/admin/media/'+encodeURIComponent(m.id),{method:'PATCH',body:JSON.stringify({alt:$('#mediaAlt').value||null,title:$('#mediaTitle').value||null,description:$('#mediaDescription').value||null,caption:$('#mediaCaption').value||null,creator:$('#mediaCreator').value||null,credit:$('#mediaCredit').value||null,decorative:$('#mediaDecorative').checked,tags:$('#mediaTags').value.split(',').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean)})});showToast('Media details saved.');await loadMedia();openMediaDetail(m.id)}catch(err){showToast(err.message,false)}};$('#mediaDownloadOne').onclick=()=>downloadMedia(m);$('#mediaOptimizeOne').onclick=()=>optimizeMedia(m);$('#mediaDeleteOne').onclick=()=>deleteMedia(m)}
function downloadMedia(m){const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=m.url;a.download=m.originalName||m.filename;a.target='_blank';a.rel='noopener';document.body.appendChild(a);a.click();a.remove()}
async function deleteMedia(m){if(m.usage?.length&&!confirm(`This file is used in ${m.usage.length} place(s). Delete anyway?`))return;if(!m.usage?.length&&!confirm('Delete this media file?'))return;try{await api('/admin/media/'+encodeURIComponent(m.id),{method:'DELETE'});mediaSelected.delete(m.id);showToast('Media deleted.');$('#mediaDetail').innerHTML='<p class="notice">Select an asset to inspect its details and usage.</p>';await loadMedia()}catch(e){showToast(e.message,false)}}
async function optimizeMedia(m){
  if(!m)return null;
  const mime=String(m.mimeType||'').toLowerCase();
  if(mime==='image/svg+xml'){showToast('SVG is vector-based; browser raster optimization is skipped.',false);return null}
  if(!mime.startsWith('image/')||['image/gif','image/x-icon','image/avif'].includes(mime)){showToast('This image type is not supported for browser optimization.',false);return null}
  const name=m.originalName||m.filename||'image';
  setMediaProgress('OPTIMIZING IMAGE…',1,0,0,name,3);
  let objectUrl='';
  try{
    setMediaProgress('READING SOURCE…',1,0,0,name,12);
    const r=await fetch(m.url,{credentials:'include',cache:'no-store'});
    if(!r.ok)throw new Error(`Could not read source image (${r.status}).`);
    const blob=await r.blob();
    if(!blob.size)throw new Error('Source image is empty.');

    setMediaProgress('DECODING SOURCE…',1,0,0,name,25);
    let bitmap=null;
    if(typeof createImageBitmap==='function'){
      try{bitmap=await createImageBitmap(blob,{imageOrientation:'from-image'});}catch{}
    }
    let source=bitmap;
    let img=null;
    if(!source){
      img=new Image();
      objectUrl=URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      img.src=objectUrl;
      await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{img.onload=resolve;img.onerror=()=>reject(new Error('Browser could not decode the source image.'));});
      try{await img.decode?.()}catch{}
      source=img;
    }
    const naturalW=source.width||source.naturalWidth;
    const naturalH=source.height||source.naturalHeight;
    if(!naturalW||!naturalH)throw new Error('Could not determine image dimensions.');

    const maxW=2400,maxH=2400;
    const scale=Math.min(1,maxW/naturalW,maxH/naturalH);
    const canvas=document.createElement('canvas');
    canvas.width=Math.max(1,Math.round(naturalW*scale));
    canvas.height=Math.max(1,Math.round(naturalH*scale));
    const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d',{alpha:true});
    if(!ctx)throw new Error('Browser canvas is unavailable.');
    ctx.imageSmoothingEnabled=true;
    ctx.imageSmoothingQuality='high';
    ctx.drawImage(source,0,0,canvas.width,canvas.height);
    try{bitmap?.close?.()}catch{}
    if(objectUrl)URL.revokeObjectURL(objectUrl);

    setMediaProgress('ENCODING WEBP…',1,0,0,name,58);
    const out=await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{
      canvas.toBlob(b=>b?resolve(b):reject(new Error('WebP encoding is not available in this browser.')),'image/webp',0.82);
    });
    const before=blob.size;
    let finalBlob=out;
    let ext='.webp';
    let type='image/webp';
    if(!finalBlob||!finalBlob.size)throw new Error('Optimizer produced an empty file.');
    // If WebP is not smaller, try a high-quality JPEG fallback for opaque images.
    if(finalBlob.size>=before && !mime.includes('png')){
      setMediaProgress('TRYING JPEG COPY…',1,0,0,name,68);
      const jpeg=await new Promise(resolve=>canvas.toBlob(resolve,'image/jpeg',0.80));
      if(jpeg?.size && jpeg.size<finalBlob.size){finalBlob=jpeg;ext='.jpg';type='image/jpeg';}
    }
    const outName=name.replace(/\.[^.]+$/,'')+'-optimized'+ext;
    const file=new File([finalBlob],outName,{type});
    setMediaProgress('UPLOADING OPTIMIZED COPY…',1,0,0,outName,82);
    const uploaded=await uploadImage(file);
    if(!uploaded?.media?.id)throw new Error('Optimized file uploaded but no media record was returned.');
    setMediaProgress('OPTIMIZATION COMPLETE',1,1,0,outName,100);
    showToast(`Optimized copy created: ${formatBytes(before)} → ${formatBytes(file.size)}`);
    await loadMedia();
    openMediaDetail(uploaded.media.id);
    return uploaded.media;
  }catch(e){
    if(objectUrl)URL.revokeObjectURL(objectUrl);
    const msg=e?.message||'Optimization failed.';
    setMediaProgress('OPTIMIZATION FAILED',1,0,1,name,100);
    showToast(msg,false);
    return null;
  }finally{
    setTimeout(()=>finishMediaProgress(),1800);
  }
}
function uploadOneWithProgress(file,onProgress){return new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const xhr=new XMLHttpRequest();xhr.open('POST','/api/admin/media/upload');xhr.withCredentials=true;xhr.setRequestHeader('Content-Type',file.type);xhr.setRequestHeader('X-Filename',encodeURIComponent(file.name));xhr.upload.onprogress=e=>{if(e.lengthComputable)onProgress(e.loaded,e.total)};xhr.onload=()=>{let d={};try{d=JSON.parse(xhr.responseText||'{}')}catch{}if(xhr.status>=200&&xhr.status<300)resolve(d);else reject(new Error(d.error||'Image upload failed'));};xhr.onerror=()=>reject(new Error('Upload connection failed.'));xhr.ontimeout=()=>reject(new Error('Upload timed out.'));xhr.timeout=120000;xhr.send(file)})}
async function uploadMediaFiles(files){const list=[...files];if(!list.length)return;const max=25*1024*1024;const valid=list.filter(f=>f.size<=max&&f.type.startsWith('image/'));const skipped=list.length-valid.length;if(!valid.length){showToast('No valid image files selected.',false);return}let done=0,failed=0;setMediaProgress('UPLOADING MEDIA…',valid.length,0,0);try{for(const f of valid){try{mediaUploadState.currentFile=f.name;mediaUploadState.currentPct=0;renderMediaProgress();await uploadOneWithProgress(f,(loaded,total)=>{mediaUploadState.currentPct=total?Math.round((loaded/total)*100):0;renderMediaProgress()});done++;mediaUploadState.done=done;mediaUploadState.currentPct=0;renderMediaProgress()}catch(e){failed++;mediaUploadState.failed=failed;renderMediaProgress()}}showToast(`${done} uploaded${failed?` · ${failed} failed`:''}${skipped?` · ${skipped} skipped`:''}.`,failed===0);await loadMedia()}finally{finishMediaProgress();document.querySelector('#mediaUpload').value=''}}

const ADMIN_TAB_NAMES=['dashboard','analytics','seo','operations','leads','motion','projects','content','brands','media','imports','homepage','production-navigation','control-center','maintenance','account'];
function openAdminTab(name,{syncUrl=true}={}){
  name=String(name||'dashboard').trim();
  const panel=$('#'+name+'Tab');
  if(!panel)return false;
  $$('.tab[data-tab]').forEach(item=>{
    const active=item.dataset.tab===name;
    item.classList.toggle('active',active);
    if(active)item.setAttribute('aria-current','page');else item.removeAttribute('aria-current');
  });
  document.querySelector('.admin-main > .admin-top')?.classList.toggle('hidden',name!=='dashboard');
  ADMIN_TAB_NAMES.forEach(key=>$('#'+key+'Tab')?.classList.toggle('hidden',name!==key));
  panel.classList.remove('hidden');
  if(syncUrl){
    const url=new URL(location.href);
    url.hash='admin-'+name;
    history.replaceState({adminTab:name},'',url);
  }
  document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('admin:tabchange',{detail:{name,panel}}));
  if(name==='dashboard')loadDashboard();
  if(name==='account')loadAccount();
  if(name==='maintenance'){switchMaintenancePanel('overview');loadMaintenance()}
  if(name==='media'){loadMediaView();loadMedia()}
  if(name==='homepage')loadHomepage();
  if(name==='production-navigation')window.loadProductionNavigation?.();
  if(name==='control-center')window.loadControlCenter?.();
  if(name==='analytics')window.loadAnalytics?.();
  if(name==='seo')window.loadSeo?.();
  if(name==='operations')window.loadOperations?.();
  if(name==='leads')window.loadLeadCenter?.();
  if(name==='motion')window.loadMotionControls?.();
  return true;
}
window.openAdminTab=openAdminTab;
// One delegated handler covers both server-rendered and asynchronously injected destinations.
// Capture phase also prevents stale per-button handlers from running the same loader twice.
document.addEventListener('click',event=>{
  const item=event.target.closest?.('.tab[data-tab]');
  if(!item||item.disabled||item.hidden)return;
  event.preventDefault();
  event.stopImmediatePropagation();
  openAdminTab(item.dataset.tab);
},true);
window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>{
  const name=location.hash.match(/^#admin-([a-z0-9-]+)$/)?.[1];
  if(name)openAdminTab(name,{syncUrl:false});
});
function esc(v){return String(v??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,m=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#039;'}[m]))}
function isoToLocal(v){if(!v)return '';const d=new Date(v);if(Number.isNaN(d.getTime()))return '';const pad=n=>String(n).padStart(2,'0');return `${d.getFullYear()}-${pad(d.getMonth()+1)}-${pad(d.getDate())}T${pad(d.getHours())}:${pad(d.getMinutes())}`}
function localToIso(v){return v?new Date(v).toISOString():null}
